'''EVA Unit-13''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = EVA Unit-13
|image = E 647.png
|money drop = 10,000¢ - 39,500¢
|appearance = [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event#Final Battle: EVA Unit-13|Final Battle: EVA Unit-13]]
}}

==Enemy==
This traitless enemy boasts gargantuan stats, with very high health and extreme damage split into three closely-spaced multi-hits that apply a 5-second slow and generate a level 1 mini-surge even further. It is invulnerable to a variety of effects, has a somewhat fast attack rate, and despite its low range, its Omni Strike ensures nothing sneaks past, so it's vital to time your attackers well and defeat any support that tags along.

==Strategy==
EVA Unit-13 isn't an EVA Angel, which makes the fight against it that much harder, as next to no anti-Traitless units consistently work against it.

Notably, this enemy is ''not'' Immune to Curse, so a well-timed Curseblast can be used to give your units a window of opportunity.

